# Curated launch feed. `briefs/` (the .md + .png + .attest.json a funded e2e
# run produced) and the rendered `site/` are committed so a fresh Railway
# deploy serves the feed immediately. The build/start steps regenerate `site/`
# from `briefs/`. For runtime-added on-demand briefs / horizontal scale, point
# BRIEFS_DIR + SITE_DIR at a Railway persistent volume (see README). A published
# brief is immutable — its bytes are hashed into the on-chain Memo.
/demo-out/

# public-repo scrub build dir
/.public-build/

# typescript SAP shim — keep src in repo, never node_modules
sap/node_modules/
sap/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
